  "notes": "Track B2 is a medley of songs.\n\nTitle misprinted on the labels: \n\"The Appollo Theater Presents, In Person, The James Brown Show Recorded Live at the Appollo Theater, New York City, October 24, 1962\".\n\nThis version is a 1963 mono pressing release with the 'crown-less' King label. Later issues with the 'crown' King label were released beginning in 1966.\n\nLabel variation with the catalog number and matrix numbers printed closer together on the labels than on other pressings.\n\nThe tracklist is not listed on the labels and is incomplete on the cover. The tracklist on this page reflects the audio.\n\nTitle printed on the front cover: \n\"The Apollo Theatre Presents - In Person! The James Brown Show Recorded Live At The Famous Apollo Theatre, New York City\".\n\nTitle printed on the spine: \"James Brown Live At The Apollo\".\nTitle printed on the back cover: \"James Brown 'Live' At The Apollo\".\n\nRunouts are etched\n\nLost Someone is split over the end of side A and beginning of side B",
  "released_formatted": "May 1963",
